### ============================================================================
### Practical 4: Task Management REST API Test Suite
### Compatible with Visual Studio Code REST Client extension (Humao.rest-client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET all tasks (Expected Status: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. POST a valid task (Expected Status: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Study for Express Viva",
  "description": "Learn middleware, routing, and HTTP status codes",
  "completed": false
}

###

### 3. POST without a title (Expected Status: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Task missing title field",
  "completed": false
}

###

### 4. POST without application/json Content-Type (Expected Status: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: text/plain

title=No+Json+Header

###

### 5. PUT an existing task (Expected Status: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "description": "Completed Practical 4 and verified all endpoints"
}

###

### 6. PUT a nonexistent task (Expected Status: 404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Non-existent Task",
  "completed": true
}

###

### 7. PUT with an invalid ID (Expected Status: 400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/abc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid ID Task"
}

###

### 8. DELETE an existing task (Expected Status: 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/2

###

### 9. DELETE a nonexistent task (Expected Status: 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/9999

###

### 10. Request an undefined route (Expected Status: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/non-existent-endpoint
Accept: application/json
